OL,3,GNEWSARapist's victim secretly recorded
OL,4,Aconfession in cafe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rapist was caught after his victim
OL,7,Fsecretly recorded his confession in a
OL,8,Fcafe, a court has heard.
OL,10,FDavid Smyth admitted having sex with
OL,11,Fthe woman while she slept at a property
OL,12,Fin Falkirk in 2019, after she had been
OL,13,Fon a night out with friends.
OL,15,FThe High Court in Stirling heard Smyth
OL,16,Flater told his victim: "You couldn't
OL,17,Fsay no in the state you were in."
OL,19,FThe 36-year-old was found guilty of
OL,20,Fraping the woman and remanded in
OL,21,Fcustody. He will be sentenced on 19
OL,22,FNovember.
